{#
| Variable                   | Type        | Description                                                          |
|----------------------------|-------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------|
| page                       | object      |                                                                      |
| page.title                 | string      | *could be html                                                       |
| page.slug                  | string      | ex: "cat.show"                                                       |
| category                   | ?Category   |                                                                      |
| category.name              | string      |                                                                      |
| category.url               | string      |                                                                      |
| category.sub_categories    | ?Category[] |                                                                      |
| category.image             | ?string     |                                                                      |
| filters                     | bool        | is filters allowed here or not                                        |
| sort_options[]             | SortList[]  |                                                                      |
| sort_options[].id          | string      | ourSuggest, bestSell, topRated, priceFromTopToLow, priceFromLowToTop |
| sort_options[].name        | string      |                                                                      |
| sort_options[].is_selected | bool        | Is current page sorted by it                                         |
| search_query               | ?string     |                                                                      |

  PC Palace listing page (reference: pcpalace-theme/pages/category-laptops.html and products.html):
  title banner, sub-category slider, filter sidebar, sort menu, 24-product grid and "load more".
  Products, filters and paging come from Salla's products API (palace-reference.js, listing()).
#}
{% extends "layouts.master" %}
{% block content %}
{% set source_map = {'product.index': 'categories', 'product.index.latest': 'latest', 'product.index.offers': 'offers', 'product.index.search': 'search', 'product.index.tag': 'tags', 'product.index.sales': 'sales'} %}
{% set source = source_map[page.slug] is defined ? source_map[page.slug] : 'categories' %}
{% set value = source == 'search' ? search_query : (source in ['latest', 'offers', 'sales'] ? null : page.id) %}
{% set title = category ? category.name : (search_query ?: page.title|striptags) %}
{% set sorts = sort_options|default([]) %}
{% set current_sort = sorts|first %}
{% for sort in sorts %}{% if sort.is_selected %}{% set current_sort = sort %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
{% set config = {'source': source, 'value': value, 'limit': 24, 'sort': current_sort ? current_sort.id : ''} %}

<div class="s-blocks-wrapper s-before-products-list">{% hook 'product.index.before_products_group_with_filter' %}</div>

{% set listing_description = category ? category.description : '' %}
{% set listing_children = category ? category.sub_categories : [] %}
{# Salla's filters component, shown in the listing's sidebar #}
{% set listing_filters %}<div class="salla-island palace-filters"><salla-filters id="filters-menu"></salla-filters></div>{% endset %}
{% include 'pages.partials.palace-listing' %}

<div class="s-blocks-wrapper s-after-products-list">{% hook 'product.index.after_products_group_with_filter' %}</div>

{#
    Hook: product.index.after_testimonials
    Fires after the testimonials (store reviews) section.
#}
<div class="s-blocks-wrapper s-after-testimonials">{% hook 'product.index.after_testimonials' %}</div>
{% endblock %}
